      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I don’t know what you did, but I managed to find\nHawlucha again after that!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt was really lethargic, though.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 116
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And...ever since then, it’s been acting...strange.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0064002E002E002E0065007600650072002000730069006E006300650020007400680065006E002C002000690074201900730020006200650065006E00200061006300740069006E0067002E002E002E0073007400720061006E00670065002E00100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
